ine justification for each non-green rating.]</p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"milestones\\\">\\n    <h2>3. Milestones &amp; Timeline</h2>\\n    <table>\\n      <caption>Milestone status vs. baseline plan</caption>\\n      <thead>\\n        <tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Milestone</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Baseline</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Forecast/Actual</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Status</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Complete</th></tr>\\n      </thead>\\n      <tbody>\\n        <!-- EDIT: one row per milestone; meter max=100, value=percent -->\\n        <tr><td>[Milestone A]</td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td><td><data class=\\\"rag rag-green\\\" value=\\\"green\\\">ON TRACK</data></td><td><meter min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"100\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">0%</meter></td></tr>\\n        <tr><td>[Milestone B]</td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td><td><data class=\\\"rag rag-amber\\\" value=\\\"amber\\\">AT RISK</data></td><td><meter min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"100\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">0%</meter></td></tr>\\n      </tbody>\\n    </table>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"progress\\\">\\n    <h2>4. Progress This Period</h2>\\n    <!-- EDIT: accomplishments as list items; quantify where possible -->\\n    <ul>\\n      <li class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Accomplishment 1 — deliverable, owner, quantified outcome]</li>\\n      <li class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Accomplishment 2]</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <!-- EDIT: planned-vs-actual variance note -->\\n    <p><strong>Plan vs. actual:</strong> <span class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[e.g., 8 of 9 planned items delivered; item X slipped to next period because …]</span></p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"upcoming\\\">\\n    <h2>5. Next Period</h2>\\n    <!-- EDIT: committed work for the coming window -->\\n    <ul>\\n      <li class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Committed item — target date]</li>\\n      <li class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Committed item — target date]</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"risks\\\">\\n    <h2>6. Risks &amp; Issues</h2>\\n    <table>\\n      <caption>Top risks and issues (severity × likelihood; owner accountable for mitigation)</caption>\\n      <thead>\\n        <tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">ID</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Description</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Severity</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Likelihood</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Owner</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Mitigation / next action</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Review by</th></tr>\\n      </thead>\\n      <tbody>\\n        <!-- EDIT: one row per risk/issue; RAG- color the Severity cell -->\\n        <tr><td>R1</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Risk description and impact]</td><td><data class=\\\"rag rag-red\\\" value=\\\"red\\\">HIGH</data></td><td>[H/M/L]</td><td>[owner]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[mitigation]</td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td></tr>\\n        <tr><td>I1</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Issue currently occurring]</td><td><data class=\\\"rag rag-amber\\\" value=\\\"amber\\\">MED</data></td><td>—</td><td>[owner]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[resolution action]</td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td></tr>\\n      </tbody>\\n    </table>\\n    <!-- EDIT: note changes since last report; delete line if first report -->\\n    <p><em>Changes since last report:</em> <span class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[new / closed / escalated items]</span></p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"decisions\\\">\\n    <h2>7. Decisions Needed</h2>\\n    <table>\\n      <caption>Asks of the sponsor — indecision past the required-by date has a cost</caption>\\n      <thead>\\n        <tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Decision</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Context / options</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Impact of delay</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Needed by</th></tr>\\n      </thead>\\n      <tbody>\\n        <!-- EDIT: one row per ask; delete section + TOC entry if none -->\\n        <tr><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Decision required]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[Options A/B and recommendation]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[cost/slip if late]</td><td><time datetime=\\\"[YYYY-MM-DD]\\\">[date]</time></td></tr>\\n      </tbody>\\n    </table>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"budget\\\">\\n    <h2>8. Budget &amp; Resources</h2>\\n    <table>\\n      <caption>Spend vs. plan (delete section if not tracked)</caption>\\n      <thead>\\n        <tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Measure</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Plan</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Actual/Forecast</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Variance</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Note</th></tr>\\n      </thead>\\n      <tbody>\\n        <tr><td>Spend to date</td><td>[amount]</td><td>[amount]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[+/-]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[explanation]</td></tr>\\n        <tr><td>Forecast at completion</td><td>[budget]</td><td>[forecast]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[+/-]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[driver]</td></tr>\\n      </tbody>\\n    </table>\\n    <!-- EDIT: staffing changes, ramp-up/down -->\\n    <p><strong>Resources:</strong> <span class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[headcount changes, new joins, gaps]</span></p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"changes\\\">\\n    <h2>9. Scope &amp; Change Log</h2>\\n    <table>\\n      <caption>Change requests this period (delete section if none)</caption>\\n      <thead>\\n        <tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">CR ID</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Summary</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Status</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Schedule impact</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Cost impact</th></tr>\\n      </thead>\\n      <tbody>\\n        <!-- EDIT: one row per change request -->\\n        <tr><td>CR-[n]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[change summary]</td><td>[Submitted/Approved/Rejected]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[+days]</td><td class=\\\"placeholder\\\">[+amount]</td></tr>\\n      </tbody>\\n    </table>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"appendix\\\">\\n    <h2>Appendix</h2>\\n    <h3>Glossary</h3>\\n    <!-- EDIT: define jargon used in this report -->\\n    <dl>\\n      <dt>[Term]</dt><dd>[Definition]</dd>\\n    </dl>\\n    <h3>References</h3>\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"[url]\\\">[Linked document / dashboard]</a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </section>\\n\\n</main>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <!-- EDIT: confidentiality + contact -->\\n  <p>[Confidentiality statement] &middot; Prepared by [author] &middot; Questions: [email]</p>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\",\"path\":\"report-template.html\"}"}}]}}]}

